    "teacher_markdown": "- Sort the records by Before 2000.\r\n- Count the songs in each group.\r\n- Count the Bangers in each group.\r\n- Write the four counts in your guide.",
    "dynamic_instructions": "{\r\n  \"datasetView\": \"- Click the sort button on the **Before 2025** column. The No records and the Yes records line up in two groups.\\n- Click **Filter**, choose **Before 2025**, check **Yes**, and click **Done**. The number next to **Dataset** shows how many records came out before 2025. Count the Bangers.\\n- Click the **Before 2025: Yes** filter to bring back the checkboxes. Uncheck **Yes**, check **No**, and click **Done**. Count the records and the Bangers again.\\n- Click the **×** on the filter to clear it.\\n- Write the four counts in your guide. Circle balanced or unbalanced, and write one reason using your counts.\"\r\n}"
